      `the day I was given the assistance` IS A DATE @desc On what date was the assistance given?
      `the day my capital is being worked out` IS A DATE @desc On what date is your capital being calculated?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Is early years assistance I received disregarded` IF
    `Sch 10 para 21 — early years assistance` `it is early years assistance under section 32 of the 2018 Act` `the day I was given the assistance` `the day my capital is being worked out`

